2. FFmpeg -- optional managed audio tools
===============================================================================
Status in this package:  NOT BUNDLED
Upstream:                https://ffmpeg.org
Windows build provider:  https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds
Used for:                audio preview, conversion, stock-format music replacement,
                         and full-length music-bank rebuilds

Audio Lab can install a Windows x64 LGPL shared FFmpeg build into audio_tools\bin.
The installer downloads the matching checksum file, verifies the archive SHA-256,
rejects GPL/nonfree build flags, confirms libmp3lame is available, and records the
exact installed release and checksum in audio_tools\SOURCE_INFORMATION.txt.

The app invokes ffmpeg.exe as a separate command-line process and does not link to
FFmpeg libraries. See AUDIO_TOOLS_LICENSE_AND_SOURCE.txt for the complete component
workflow and source information.

